title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322052212:1":{"text":"后来我的确复活成了亡灵。但很长一段时间我都浑浑噩噩，不记得生前的事情，也忘了雪米拉和戴蒙。我不知道戴蒙病死，雪米拉痛苦得几乎死去……","source_cn":"后来我的确复活成了亡灵。但很长一段时间我都浑浑噩噩，不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45172C4B252AAE82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1322052213:1":{"text":"我生前为了工作，常常不在她身边，无法和她一起照顾孩子，也无法给她足够的安全感，她时时刻刻都活在担心和忧虑中。最后，戴蒙病亡的事情压垮了她。","source_cn":"我生前为了工作，常常不在她身边，无法和她一起照顾孩子，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x632B4FF4AFC097C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322052214:1":{"text":"我们以亡灵的身份团聚后，她不想再一次体验失去孩子的感受，于是把所有的关怀都倾注给了戴蒙，才会变得激进。","source_cn":"我们以亡灵的身份团聚后，她不想再一次体验失去孩子的感受...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10EF0213EE9D97CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1322052215:1":{"text":"雪米拉她并没有恶意。我们只想找个安全和安静的地方，一家人好好生活。","source_cn":"雪米拉她并没有恶意。我们只想找个安全和安静的地方，一家...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3638BFAF0F756BBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1322052216:1":{"text":"这么说，你们打算定居白山？","source_cn":"这么说，你们打算定居白山？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23D844F17B2E2466","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index